{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お弁当を持っていくために頑張って卵焼きを作りました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFYAJM60Z56H876S0MDDBR2","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と言っても私は卵をかき混ぜてフライパンを用意しただけです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お兄ちゃん(次男)が作ってくれました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以前番組で、3番目のお兄ちゃんが奇声をあげるとお伝えしたと思いますが実は2番目のお兄ちゃんも奇声をあげます。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は夜中だったので奇声をあげずに卵焼き作ってくれました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして!!今日は菅井友香ちゃんのお誕生日です!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFYAKTXCX0X2BAM7TH9SKQW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"20歳\\(﹡ˆOˆ﹡)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"友香ちゃんの笑顔が大好きすぎてひそかに研究してます。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"欅って書けない重大発表だ!わくわく。おやすみなさい!ふぉ。"}],"source":"archive"}